Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fixup! miner(v2): adapt O(1) Merklix overlay
 BlockAssembler to V2 state_root and monetary burn

Adapt amendment mailbox 0008 (25005e4f3652d231c4d177df8c1ea9b1a75bd9b4) to frozen2096. Preserve pure-native canonicalization; retain literal payout by leaving builder outputs in wrapped-v7 form. Existing source has no stateRoot copy in this loop. Matched miner suite passes10 cases1622 assertions; original wire regression fails before and passes after.
